  <http://data.tennet.eu/def/isDerivedIn> <http://data.tennet.eu/id/b6c0d29d-52d2-ee11-b6a8-001dd8d702b3>;
  <http://data.tennet.eu/def/isDerivedFrom> <http://data.tennet.eu/id/ba4b6692-cb96-30b1-92ad-77434ad70732> .

